<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><!-- SEO: Title & Description --><title>Why Plans Are Essential to Agent Harnesses: How Swarm Replaced Context Compaction with the Final Handoff System | SwarmAgent</title><meta name="description" content="An architectural deep dive into why baking planning directly into the agent runtime prevents context drift, eliminates expensive 100k-1M token compaction passes, slashes multi-agent FinOps costs, and preserves prompt cache efficiency."><link rel="canonical" href="https://swarmagent.dev/resources/engineering/plans-harnesses-and-final-handoffs/"><!-- SEO: Robots --><meta name="robots" content="index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1"><meta name="googlebot" content="index, follow"><!-- Open Graph --><meta property="og:title" content="Why Plans Are Essential to Agent Harnesses: How Swarm Replaced Context Compaction with the Final Handoff System | SwarmAgent"><meta property="og:description" content="An architectural deep dive into why baking planning directly into the agent runtime prevents context drift, eliminates expensive 100k-1M token compaction passes, slashes multi-agent FinOps costs, and preserves prompt cache efficiency."><meta property="og:image" content="https://swarmagent.dev/assets/social/plans-harnesses-and-final-handoffs.png?v=20260924-blue-1"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"><meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png"><meta property="og:url" content="https://swarmagent.dev/resources/engineering/plans-harnesses-and-final-handoffs/"><meta property="og:type" content="article"><meta property="og:site_name" content="SwarmAgent"><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="Plans, harnesses &amp; final handoffs. How Swarm coordinates agent work."><!-- Twitter Card --><meta name="twitter:card" c